OL,3,GNEWSADaughter keeps dying mum's letters
OL,4,Afor milestones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose mother died of breast
OL,7,Fcancer when she was six still has
OL,8,Funopened letters her mum left her,
OL,9,Fsaved for the biggest moments of her
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FAmy Leslie, now 22, from north London,
OL,13,Flost her mother Danielle in September
OL,14,F2010, just over a year after her
OL,15,Fgrandmother Sylvie Henry died of the
OL,16,Fsame disease.
OL,18,FBefore they died, the pair, both
OL,19,Fprofessional dancers who ran their own
OL,20,Fdance school, set up a breast cancer
OL,21,Fcharity, Future Dreams, at the family
OL,22,Fkitchen table with #100.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
